","line":11},{"title":"focused action leads to presence","target":"focused action leads to presence","line":12},{"title":"authenticity in the face of reality leads to good storytelling","target":"authenticity in the face of reality leads to good storytelling","line":13},{"title":"everything is a waste of time unless you decide it isn't","target":"everything is a waste of time unless you decide it isn't","line":14},{"title":"we must be challenged to be engaged","target":"we must be challenged to be engaged","line":15},{"title":"the world is not so segmented","target":"the world is not so segmented","line":16},{"title":"Reflection is a crucial part of life, but it doesn't come naturally.","target":"Reflection is a crucial part of life, but it doesn't come naturally.","line":17},{"title":"the mundane can be exciting if we approach it right","target":"the mundane can be exciting if we approach it right","line":18},{"title":"people store memories in objects and people","target":"people store memories in objects and people","line":19},{"title":"I started exploring new ways of thinking, questioning what to do, why, when to do it, and really, Beau, what's the bloody point to all this questioning?","target":"I started exploring new ways of thinking, questioning what to do, why, when to do it, and really, Beau, what's the bloody point to all this questioning?","line":47},{"title":"Near-misses come and go, so you harden up a little and learn as only fools and experts can.","target":"Near-misses come and go, so you harden up a little and learn as only fools and experts can.","line":49},{"title":"You forget to drink when you're always wet, or looking at a vast desert of liquid.","target":"You forget to drink when you're always wet, or looking at a vast desert of liquid.","line":51},{"title":"Such a breakthrough in thinking is to acknowledge that I have a uniqueness born of influences.","target":"Such a breakthrough in thinking is to acknowledge that I have a uniqueness born of influences.","line":53},{"title":"You come to rely on gadgets and digital numbers like grease on lips and milk on cereal, and I don't like the feeling when the batteries die, as if you've lost part of your brain.","target":"You come to rely on gadgets and digital numbers like grease on lips and milk on cereal, and I don't like the feeling when the batteries die, as if you've lost part of your brain.","line":55}],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
